    <pattern>I NEED IT SOON</pattern>
    <template>Rush delivery is available for all package sizes — just mention your deadline in your inquiry and we'll confirm studio availability. Our standard turnaround is 2–4 weeks for a single; expedited options can bring that down significantly depending on the timeline.
      <nav-card label="Start Your Inquiry" href="/contact" description="Mention your deadline in the form"/>
    </template>
  </category>

