  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I DOWNLOAD THE SONG</pattern>
    <template>We deliver your commission as broadcast-ready WAV and MP3 files. Once complete, we send you a secure download link — no special software required. Stems (individual separated tracks) are available as an optional add-on if you need maximum flexibility.</template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Social media use ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I USE IT ON SOCIAL MEDIA</pattern>
    <template>Your commission includes full commercial rights covering all major social media platforms — YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, and more. Your 80% royalty share applies to any monetized use as well. We handle PRO registration so your royalties are collected automatically from day one.</template>
  </category>

