  <!-- ── Differentiation ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW ARE YOU DIFFERENT</pattern>
    <template>Brass Note Studios is a full-service atelier — not a marketplace or a prompt generator. You work with a dedicated team of songwriters and producers who shape every element of your commission around your story. The result is an original, emotionally intentional piece that could never come from a template or a gig listing alone.</template>
  </category>

